cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use xmas in your research, please cite it as below."
title: xmas
abstract: >-
  A framework for building, running and optimizing multi-agent systems. A system is a
  typed graph of agents, code steps, people and chains, saved as a .mas bundle, with
  every run logged; its prompts, wiring and models are optimizable components.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zehle
    given-names: Tom
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gepromptet/xmas"
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - prompt optimization
  - large language models
  - agentic systems
